No matter what inferiority complex, with improvisational platelets, hold it down, plunge in.

54
00:08:13,408 --> 00:08:16,908
Up and down なテンション ねぇまいっちゃってんの相当
Up and down tension, I'm getting quite overwhelmed.

55
00:08:17,008 --> 00:08:20,908
ドバッと噴き出すのは 本音の独り言
Gushing out all at once is the monologue of true feelings.

56
