呼呼、手を伸ばせば 伸ばすほどに
Ah, the more that I reach out my hands,

264
00:30:44,103 --> 00:30:47,163
遠くへゆく
the further away they go.

265
00:30:47,163 --> 00:30:50,603
思うようにいかない、今日も
Things don't go as I wish today either,

266
00:30:50,603 --> 00:30:53,983
また慌ただしくもがいてる
as I struggle in a hurried frenzy once more.

267
00:30:53,983 --> 00:30:57,223
悔しい気持ちも ただ情けなくて
Feelings of frustration and sheer helplessness

268
