重いまぶた擦る夜に
on a night rubbing my heavy eyelids,

273
00:31:17,443 --> 00:31:21,003
しがみついた青い誓い
I clung tightly to a blue vow.

274
00:31:21,003 --> 00:31:23,883
好きなことを続けること
Continuing to do what you love—

275
00:31:23,883 --> 00:31:27,003
それは「楽しい」だけじゃない
it's not just all fun and games.

276
00:31:27,003 --> 00:31:30,403
本当にできる? 不安になるけど
"Can I really do this?" Though doubts creep in,

277
00:31:30,403 --> 00:31:34,163
何枚でも ほら何枚でも
time and time again, look, page after page,

278
00:31:34,163 --> 00:31:37,363
自信がないから描いてきたんだよ
I kept drawing because I lacked confidence.

279
00:31:37,363 --> 00:31:41,183
何回でも ほら何回でも
Time and time again, look, trial after trial,

280
00:31:41,183 --> 00:31:44,783
積み上げてきたことが武器になる
everything I've piled up becomes my weapon.

281
