Unread chats and love calls pile up—"Don't get in my way!"

303
00:33:56,003 --> 00:34:01,883
Cuz you refuse cooperation, better stick out your lip. Too used to sayin' "I don't wanna", no doubt you're still a kid

304
00:34:01,883 --> 00:34:05,203
本音は言わない方が悩ましい
It's more troubling when you hide your true feelings,

305
00:34:05,203 --> 00:34:08,923
甘い言葉かけるよりもずっと愛しい
and far more endearing than sweet words.

306
00:34:08,923 --> 00:34:13,923
たまらなくなるほど 求めて離さないで
Craving you so much it drives me crazy, hold me tight and never let go.

307
00:34:13,923 --> 00:34:19,383
キスじゃ足りなくて いっそ殺して
A kiss isn't enough, just kill me instead.

308
00:34:19,383 --> 00:34:21,883
Predilection あなたを手にかけて
Predilection, taking you into my hands,

309
00:34:21,883 --> 00:34:24,643
Infatuation 呼吸さえしとめて
Infatuation, stopping even your breath,

310
00:34:24,643 --> 00:34:27,163
Dedication このまま
Dedication, just like this,

311
00:34:27,163 --> 00:34:31,003
Addiction してまだ たった一口で「終わり」
Addiction, ending with just a single bite.

312
00:34:31,003 --> 00:34:33,523
Predilection さあさ口をつけて
Predilection, come on, put your lips to mine,

313
00:34:33,523 --> 00:34:36,763
Infatuation そのまま飲み込んで
Infatuation, swallow me down just as I am,

314
00:34:36,763 --> 00:34:38,983
Dedication すぐさま
Dedication, right away,

315
00:34:38,983 --> 00:34:43,403
Addiction してほら たった一口「死ぬほど」愛したいから
Addiction, because I want to love you to death with just one bite.

316
00:34:43,403 --> 00:34:46,083
Don't take your love away, You ain't heard nothin' yet-yet

317
00:34:46,083 --> 00:34:49,083
Don't take your love away, Wake up, make up, bang bang

318
00:34:49,083 --> 00:34:52,523
Uh, have it all, like it love is overflowing

319
00:34:52,523 --> 00:34:55,803
Be the only one you got, I don't think you'll be going, going

320
00:34:55,803 --> 00:34:59,048
Uh, take it off, still it's not enough for me, Stuck. With. You. There's no room for other things.

321
00:35:01,946 --> 00:35:03,856
胸を刺した この手掴んだ
Stabbing my chest, I grabbed this hand.

322
00:35:04,236 --> 00:35:06,206
まだ視線があるのね
You're still looking at me, aren't you?

323
00:35:06,646 --> 00:35:09,356
あああなたわ ワガママ
Ah, you are so selfish.

324
00:35:10,016 --> 00:35:12,926
愛と名付けてまた支配する
Naming it love, you dominate me again.

325
00:35:13,686 --> 00:35:18,966
あなたに溺れてく 息苦しくらいに
Drowning in you, to the point of suffocation.

326
00:35:19,386 --> 00:35:23,056
深酔いそうそうと急上昇して
Getting overly drunk and rapidly rising up.

327
00:35:24,826 --> 00:35:26,596
私を手にかけて
Take my life into your hands

328
00:35:27,326 --> 00:35:29,676
キスで口塞いで
And seal my lips with a kiss.

329
00:35:30,116 --> 00:35:35,396
知てんだずっと 非情に好きよ
I've always known, I love you ruthlessly.

330
00:35:35,876 --> 00:35:39,116
咽流し込んで 届くなら仕込んで
Swallowing it down, if it reaches you, train me.

331
00:35:39,196 --> 00:35:41,926
邪魔だ今のは捨てて
Throw away what's in the way now.

332
00:35:42,256 --> 00:35:47,936
すぐさま 知てまった 一口これで終わらせないで
Realizing it instantly, don't let it end with just one bite.

333
00:35:48,395 --> 00:35:50,995
Our loves, loves continue to further evolve more.

334
00:35:51,235 --> 00:35:54,155
My love love is besotted with you.

335
00:35:54,155 --> 00:35:57,856
You love? love? continue to further evolve mo-mo-more!

336
00:35:58,256 --> 00:35:59,056
I'm a little confused.

337
00:35:59,476 --> 00:36:01,936
You already know it, love is war.

338
00:36:02,216 --> 00:36:05,206
What you gotta act righteous for?

339
00:36:05,206 --> 00:36:08,616
Won't ya come and fight me? Shit, Aphrodite was supposed to only wanna be adored.

340
00:36:08,616 --> 00:36:11,776
You can ditch your world. Cuz I'm all you need.

341
00:36:11,776 --> 00:36:14,556
With those wild words, I fall to my knees.

342
00:36:14,556 --> 00:36:17,256
In the end, the reason isn't hard to see.

343
00:36:17,256 --> 00:36:18,556
Understanding "love," it just ain't for me.

344
00:36:11,915 --> 00:36:16,955
たまに苦しくなるほど 求め手離さないで
To the point of occasional pain, seek me and don't let me go.

345
00:36:17,475 --> 00:36:21,895
キスじゃ足りなくていっそ殺して
A kiss isn't enough, just kill me instead.

346
00:36:24,875 --> 00:36:26,755
あなたを手にかけて
Take my life into your hands

347
00:36:27,235 --> 00:36:29,805
呼吸さえしてとめて
And even stop my breath.

348
00:36:30,145 --> 00:36:35,455
このまま 知てんだずっと 非情に好きよ
Staying like this, I've always known, I love you ruthlessly.

349
00:36:36,045 --> 00:36:39,175
さあさあ 口をつけて そのまま飲み込んで
Come on, put your lips to mine and swallow it down as is.

350
00:36:39,445 --> 00:36:42,285
邪魔だ今のは捨てて すぐさま
Throw away what's in the way now, immediately.

351
00:36:42,565 --> 00:36:48,925
さよなら真っ赤 吐き出して 息が止まるのよ今
Goodbye, bright red, spit it out, my breath stops right now.

352
00:37:08,856 --> 00:37:14,556
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me

353
00:37:24,523 --> 00:37:30,373
はるか遠い遠い昔 巻かれた首輪は
A long, long time ago, far away, the wrapped collar...

354
00:37:30,373 --> 00:37:36,693
人が欲しい 人が欲しい と叫ぶ 呪いの首輪
Is a cursed collar crying out 'I want people, I want people.'

355
00:37:37,153 --> 00:37:41,933
怒らないで 見捨てないで どこも行かないで
Don't get angry, don't abandon me, don't go anywhere.

356
00:37:42,933 --> 00:37:49,253
強く締める 吐くまで締める 人がいないいないと いい成績でしょ
Tightening strongly, tightening until I vomit, that there are no people is a good result, right?

357
00:37:49,253 --> 00:38:04,353
ねぇ ねぇ 良い子でしょう 可愛い子でしょう ねぇ ねぇ 良い子でしょう 苦しいね
Hey, hey, aren't I a good child? A cute child? Hey, hey, aren't I a good child? It hurts, doesn't it?

358
00:38:05,033 --> 00:38:14,733
愛して 愛して 愛して もっともっと 愛して 愛して 狂おしいほどに
Love me, love me, love me, more and more, love me, love me, until it drives me crazy.

359
00:38:17,363 --> 00:38:24,013
苦しい 苦しい 呪縛を 解いて 解いて ねぇ
It hurts, it hurts, please break the curse, break it, hey.

360
00:38:27,093 --> 00:38:29,893
止められない
I can't stop it.

361
00:39:01,429 --> 00:39:07,189
身体 身体 大きくなっても 小さい首輪は
Even if your body grows big, the small collar...

362
00:39:07,549 --> 00:39:13,899
苦しくなる 足りなくなる 人が 人が 足りない
Becomes painful, not enough, people, people are not enough.

363
00:39:13,899 --> 00:39:19,549
クラスの誰にも負けない キレイな子でしょう
I'm a pretty child who won't lose to anyone in class, right?

364
00:39:20,179 --> 00:39:26,599
あの子よりもどの子よりも 誰も彼も私を見てよ
More than that girl, more than any girl, everyone, everyone, look at me.

365
00:39:26,949 --> 00:39:34,959
体育館裏 あなたに告白を 嘘みたいでしょ あなたが好きなの
Behind the gymnasium, a confession to you. Sounds like a lie, right? I love you.

366
00:39:39,049 --> 00:39:42,029
汚いあなたが
Your dirty self...

367
00:39:42,289 --> 00:39:48,869
愛して 愛して 愛して 全部あげる あなたに あなたに 全部背負ってもらうよ
Love me, love me, love me, I'll give you everything. You will carry everything on you.

368
00:39:48,869 --> 00:39:59,056
りない あなたが 足りない 離さないよ
Not enough, you are not enough, I won't let go.

369
00:40:00,264 --> 00:40:03,264
離さないよ 鳴呼
I won't let go, ah...

370
00:40:04,264 --> 00:40:06,164
ごめんなさい
I'm sorry.

371
00:40:07,164 --> 00:40:08,914
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me,

372
00:40:08,914 --> 00:40:10,264
もっともっと
more and more!

373
00:40:10,264 --> 00:40:11,964
愛して 愛して 愛して
Love me, love me, love me,

374
00:40:11,964 --> 00:40:13,264
もっともっと
more and more!

375
00:40:13,264 --> 00:40:16,864
愛して 愛して 狂おしいほどに
Love me, love me, to the point of madness!

376
00:40:17,214 --> 00:40:19,864
苦しい 本当に
It hurts, truly,

377
00:40:19,864 --> 00:40:22,414
苦しい 離さない
it hurts, I won't let go.

378
00:40:23,064 --> 00:40:28,564
苦しい もっともっと ねぇ
It hurts, more and more, hey...

379
00:40:29,314 --> 00:40:31,914
幸せなの
Is this happiness...

380
00:40:31,914 --> 00:40:44,564
幸せなのかなぁ
...is this what happiness is?

381
00:41:19,214 --> 00:41:21,864
あたしが愛を語るのなら
If I were to speak of love,

382
00:41:21,864 --> 00:41:23,164
その眼には如何、写る？
how would it reflect in those eyes?

383
00:41:23,164 --> 00:41:25,364
詞は有り余るばかり
Words are nothing but excess,

384
00:41:25,364 --> 00:41:27,864
無垢の音が流れてく
as innocent sounds flow on.

385
00:41:28,164 --> 00:41:31,264
あなたが愛にまみれるまで
Until you are stained with love,

386
00:41:31,264 --> 00:41:34,564
その色は幻だ
that color is just an illusion.

387
00:41:34,564 --> 00:41:37,264
ひとりぼっち 音に呑まれれば
If you're swallowed up by the sound all alone,

388
00:41:37,264 --> 00:41:39,864
全世界共通の快楽さ
it's a universal pleasure across the world.

389
00:41:54,264 --> 00:41:56,864
つまらない茫然に溺れる暮らし
A boring life sinking into vague blankness,

390
00:41:56,864 --> 00:41:59,064
誰もが彼をなぞる
everyone traces his footsteps.

391
00:41:59,064 --> 00:42:02,064
繰り返す使い回しの歌にまた耳を塞いだ
I plugged my ears once again to the repetitive, recycled song.

392
00:42:02,064 --> 00:42:05,564
あなたが愛を語るのならそれを答とするの？
If you speak of love, is that your answer?

393
00:42:05,564 --> 00:42:09,564
目ををつぶったふりをしているならこの曲で醒ましてくれ！
If you're pretending to close your eyes, wake up with this song!

394
00:42:12,164 --> 00:42:16,064
誰も知らぬ物語 想うばかり
Thinking only of a story nobody knows,

395
00:42:16,064 --> 00:42:20,064
壊れそうなくらいに抱き締めて泣き踊った
I hugged myself tight enough to break and danced while crying.

396
00:42:20,064 --> 00:42:24,064
見境無い感情論 許されるのならば 泣き出すことすらできないまま呑み込んでった
Indiscriminate emotionalism—if I'm forgiven, I swallowed it all down without even being able to cry.

397
00:42:24,064 --> 00:42:27,564
張り裂けてしまいそうな心があるってこと、叫ばせて！
Let me scream that I have a heart on the verge of bursting!

398
00:42:29,064 --> 00:42:36,564
世界があたしを拒んでも 今、愛の唄歌わせてくれないかな
Even if the world rejects me, won't you let me sing a song of love right now?

399
00:42:37,064 --> 00:42:46,064
もう一回 誰も知らないその想い この声に預けてみてもいいかな
Once more, can I entrust this unknown feeling to this voice?

400
00:42:46,064 --> 00:42:49,864
あなたには僕が見えるか？ あなたには僕が見えるか？
Can you see me? Can you see me?

401
00:42:50,064 --> 00:42:54,864
ガラクタばかり投げつけられてきたその背中
That back, onto which only junk was thrown,

402
00:42:55,064 --> 00:42:59,064
それでも好きと言えたなら それでも好きを願えたら
if I could still say I love you, if I could still wish for love—

403
00:42:59,064 --> 00:43:03,064
ああ、あたしの全部にその意味はあると
Ah, that my entire existence has meaning.

404
00:43:29,264 --> 00:43:32,064
ねぇ、愛を語るのなら 今その胸には誰がいる
Hey, if you speak of love, who is in your heart right now?

405
00:43:32,064 --> 00:43:36,064
こころのはこを抉じ開けて さあ、生写しのあなた見せて？
Pry open the box of your heart and show me your living reflection.

406
00:43:36,564 --> 00:43:41,564
あたしが愛になれるのなら 今その色は何色だ
If I can become love, what color is that color right now?

407
00:43:42,064 --> 00:43:44,564
孤独なんて記号では収まらない 心臓を抱えて生きてきたんだ！
Loneliness can't be contained by mere symbols; I've lived holding my beating heart!

408
00:43:46,064 --> 00:43:49,064
ドッペルもどきが其処処に溢れた 挙句の果ての今日
Doppelganger-like things overflowed everywhere, leading to today.

409
00:43:49,564 --> 00:43:55,064
ライラ ライ ライ 心失きそれを生み出した奴等は 見切りをつけてもう バイ バイ バイ
Laira-li-li, those who created that heartless thing have given up and said bye-bye-bye.

410
00:43:55,064 --> 00:43:59,064
残されたあなたがこの場所で今でも 涙を堪えてるのどうして、どうして
You, left behind, are still holding back tears in this place—why, oh why?

411
00:43:59,064 --> 00:44:04,064
あたしは知ってるわ この場所はいつでも あなたに守られてきたってこと！
I know! This place has always been protected by you!

412
00:44:04,064 --> 00:44:07,864
痛みなどあまりにも慣れてしまった
I've grown far too used to the pain.

413
00:44:07,864 --> 00:44:13,064
何千回と巡らせ続けた 喜怒と哀楽
The joy, anger, sorrow, and pleasure that I made cycle thousands of times.

414
00:44:13,064 --> 00:44:17,064
失えない喜びがこの世界にあるならば 手放すことすらできない悲しみさえあたしは
If there is an irreplaceable joy in this world, even the sadness I can't let go of—

415
00:44:17,064 --> 00:44:21,064
この心の中 つまはじきにしてしまうのか？ それは、いやだ！
will I end up casting it out from my heart? No, I refuse that!

416
00:44:21,564 --> 00:44:30,064
どうやって この世界を愛せるかな いつだって 転がり続けるんだろう
How can I ever love this world? I'll probably just keep stumbling on forever.

417
00:44:30,064 --> 00:44:38,064
ねぇ、いっそ誰も気づかないその想い この唄で明かしてみようと思うんだよ
Hey, I think I'll try revealing that feeling, which no one notices, through this song.

418
00:44:38,064 --> 00:44:47,064
あなたが何を願うか あなたが何を望むか 刻んだ心が誰より今を生きてるの
Whatever you wish for, whatever you desire, the heart engraved within lives in the present more than anyone.

419
00:44:47,064 --> 00:44:55,564
あなたには僕が見えるか？ あなたには僕が見えるか？ それ、あたしの行く末を照らす灯火なんだろう？
Can you see me? Can you see me? Surely that must be the light illuminating my future path, right?

420
00:45:30,212 --> 00:45:34,092
ねぇ、あいをとさけぶのなら
Hey, if you're going to shout of love,

421
00:45:34,092 --> 00:45:39,032
あたしはここにいるよ ことばがありあまるほど この夢はつづいてく
I'm right here with more than enough words, this dream continues.

422
00:45:39,172 --> 00:45:43,132
あたしが愛を語るのなら そのすべてはこの歌だ
If I were to speak of love, all of it would be this song.

423
00:45:43,132 --> 00:45:47,952
誰も知らないこの物語 またクチーズさんでしまったみたいだ
This story nobody knows, looks like I got choked up again.

424
00:46:01,072 --> 00:46:04,172
握ったメッセージ that's rising hope
Grasped message, that's rising hope

425
00:46:13,112 --> 00:46:16,152
揺るがない世界 非情な現状
An unwavering world, a merciless current situation

426
00:46:16,152 --> 00:46:18,272
続く壁は何重層？
How many layers of walls continue?

427
00:46:18,272 --> 00:46:21,072
イメージ通りなんかじゃない
It's not at all what I imagined

428
00:46:21,072 --> 00:46:23,272
静かに騒ぎだした本能
An instinct that began to stir quietly

429
00:46:23,272 --> 00:46:26,012
迷いみたい 行き止まりなんだ
Like a maze, it's a dead end

430
00:46:26,112 --> 00:46:28,072
もう思考はディストーション
My thoughts are already a distortion

431
00:46:28,072 --> 00:46:30,572
容赦ないね いつの間に
So merciless, before I knew it

432
00:46:30,572 --> 00:46:33,272
見失ったルート、暴れだす
The lost route starts to rage

433
00:46:33,272 --> 00:46:34,272
Pay attention!

434
00:46:34,272 --> 00:46:35,412
Hey what is it?

435
00:46:35,412 --> 00:46:37,112
Watch your step now! 常識なんか要らない
Watch your step now! I don't need common sense

436
00:46:39,172 --> 00:46:41,272
Are you serious!? No no no, don't worry 1, 2, 3

437
00:46:41,272 --> 00:46:43,772
吹き返す 心臓のリズム
The rhythm of the heart revives

438
00:46:43,772 --> 00:46:48,872
視界まだ眩んでる それでも行かなくちゃ
My vision is still dazzled, but I still have to go

439
00:46:48,872 --> 00:46:54,472
キミが信じてる僕を 裏切るわけにいかない
I can't betray you who believes in me

440
00:46:54,472 --> 00:46:57,872
強くクラクションが鳴る
A car horn blares loudly

441
00:46:57,872 --> 00:47:02,172
孤独なまま時が経ったって
Even if time passes in solitude

442
00:47:02,172 --> 00:47:04,672
逃げる事覚えたって
Even if I learned how to run away

443
00:47:04,672 --> 00:47:07,772
新しい今日が来ちゃうけど
A new today will come anyway

444
00:47:07,772 --> 00:47:11,872
この願い 例え魔法が無なくたって
Even if this wish has no magic

445
00:47:11,872 --> 00:47:14,072
叶えなきゃ、誓った
I swore I had to make it come true

446
00:47:14,072 --> 00:47:17,872
僕はキミと まだ見たい未来 あるんだよ
I still want to see a future with you

447
00:47:17,872 --> 00:47:24,072
泣きそうでも 悔しくても止まっていられない
Even if I feel like crying, even if I feel frustrated, I can't stop

448
00:47:24,072 --> 00:47:27,772
握ったメッセージ that's rising hope
Grasped message, that's rising hope

449
00:47:41,072 --> 00:47:44,272
デモ・ケドnonstepでガンガン迫るhard way
But still, non-stop, approaching hard way

450
00:47:44,272 --> 00:47:45,972
Where's the solution!?

451
00:47:45,972 --> 00:47:47,872
打ちのめされても get up!
Even if beaten down, get up!

452
00:47:47,872 --> 00:47:49,172
Come on! Hurry up!

453
00:47:49,172 --> 00:47:52,272
そんな損な時間ならすぐさまゴミ箱
Trash such a wasteful time instantly

454
00:47:52,272 --> 00:47:54,072
後悔なんて塵埃同然
Regrets are mere dust

455
00:47:54,072 --> 00:47:57,072
さぁ2 step OK shouting OK 欲張り遊ばせ
Now 2 step OK shouting OK, play greedily

456
00:47:57,072 --> 00:48:02,372
可否も賛否も全部僕のもの 飛ばせ 心臓のアルゴリズム
Both pros and cons are entirely mine, make the algorithm of the heart fly

457
00:48:03,072 --> 00:48:06,872
ほら 守りたいんだって僕の声が伝播した
Hey, I wanted to protect it, my voice transmitted

458
00:48:06,872 --> 00:48:13,872
異論反論は許すけど この想いは不用意に科学できないでしょう？
I'll forgive objections and counterarguments, but you couldn't casually scientize this feeling, could you?

459
00:48:30,072 --> 00:48:35,572
聞いてよ 辿り着いた正解 言わなくちゃ
